\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.31}{\ignorespaces Left(Right): Higgs differential cross section as a function of rapidity of four lepton system with ATLAS (CMS) using an integrated luminosity of 139 $\ensuremath {\mathrm {fb^{-1}}}$ (137.1 $\ensuremath {\mathrm {fb^{-1}}}$). Results are shown with theory prediction in each experiment as described in \ref {theory_pred}. \relax }}{123}{figure.caption.364}
